From: =?UTF-8?q?=E4=BB=93=E9=BC=A0=E7=8E=8B?= <yjianbin419@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 01:46:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ord0262): the busy wait now comes from each
 operation's own ladder

The three named-busy raise sites carried their own retry_after_ms=500 while both
operation ladders floor a freshly queued job at 1000, so one condition promised two
different waits depending on which line answered. Routing each site through the ladder it
belongs to (generation for the two generation doors, hydration for the catalog door) removes
the last numeric literal from those emissions; nothing new is declared and no fourth constant
is introduced. The gate cell that used to pin the disagreement flips: it now refuses any bare
number at a busy site, and the positive control copies one back to prove the cell bites.
---
 backend/app/main.py                           | 31 +++++++++-----
 .../test_qoder_ord0262_narrow_contention.py   | 40 ++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/backend/app/main.py b/backend/app/main.py
